OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMany areas dry but often cloudy
OL,6,Fwith fog slow to clear. sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping for some later, mostly in
OL,8,Fthe south. Heavy showers may affect
OL,9,Fsome coasts, with patchy rain or
OL,10,Fdrizzle further north. Temperatures
OL,11,Fnear average with light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers on coasts ease.
OL,14,FCloud, rain and drizzle persist across
OL,15,Fparts of northern England and
OL,16,FScotland. Clear spells farther south
OL,17,Fmay allow local frost. Fog developing
OL,18,Fhere, can be dense.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
