OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FFog can be slow to clear in
OL,6,Fthe south, but when it does, sunny
OL,7,Fskies develop for most. Some coastal
OL,8,Fshowers in Wales and the northwest.
OL,9,FChilly despite light winds
